  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed change of use to supported living accommodation (Class C2), by reason of the inadequate level of communal facilities, internal layout and insufficient provision of high‑quality living space for future residents, would result in a poor standard of accommodation that fails to meet the needs of the intended occupiers. The proposal would not provide a suitable or dignified living environment and is therefore contrary to Policy HO7 of the Harrow Local Plan 2021 – 2041 and Policy H12 of the London Plan (2021) which seek to ensure high standards of residential accommodation, inclusive design and the protection of occupant wellbeing.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
